From db8e12b4b3fc98d6ac8f5f3469e4d2265bba7258 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: paulsvc <paulsvc02@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:45:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(2d): support Do not touch protection on Engrave
 operations

Add OpType::Engrave to do_not_touch_applies and implement
machining2d::trace_avoid so Engrave toolpaths keep flutes, shank, and
holder clear of protected faces and edge chains across cutting moves,
plunges, retracts, and rapid links. Refuse by item name when no safe
cutting room remains, preserve the baseline toolpath when no items
are protected, update the MCP description and reference doc, and add
pinning tests in motion, app, and ui.

Fixes #3349
